    "Claude's usage endpoint rate-limits aggressively; 5 minutes is the recommended floor. 429s back off automatically up to 30 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 的用量接口限流很严，建议最短 5 分钟。遇到 429 会自动退避，最长 30 分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Collecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
