        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menu bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MetricKit payloads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MetricKit 报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New token": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新生成 token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No camera available. Enter the pairing details manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有可用的相机，请手动输入配对信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No device has reported yet. Paired iPhones and Watches send their logs on every refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有设备上报。已配对的 iPhone 和手表每次刷新时会发送日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No key stored. Environment variables also work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未保存密钥。也可以用环境变量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to show yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂无内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notify me when a window crosses a threshold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口用量越过阈值时通知我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: Claude Code rotates its own tokens; a second refresher can sign it out. Opening Claude Code refreshes the token for both.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭：Claude Code 会自行轮换 token，第二个刷新者可能把它踢下线。打开一次 Claude Code 就能同时刷新两边的 token。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: QuotaPulse is a menu-bar-only app (find it top right, or search QuotaPulse in Spotlight). On: a Dock icon that reopens this window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关：QuotaPulse 只在菜单栏（右上角，或在 Spotlight 搜 QuotaPulse）。开：显示 Dock 图标，点击重新打开此窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open QuotaPulse…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 QuotaPulse…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the provider's usage dashboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开该供应商的用量面板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional direct link for paired devices and local scripts: authenticated JSON over HTTP on your network. It also receives device logs. iPhone and Apple Watch don't need it while iCloud sync is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选的直连通道，供已配对设备和本地脚本使用：在你的网络内通过 HTTP 提供带鉴权的 JSON，同时接收设备日志。开启 iCloud 同步后，iPhone 和 Apple Watch 不需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional while iCloud works. A direct link uses your network or Tailscale and also sends this device's logs to your Mac. Open QuotaPulse on the Mac → Hub & Devices, then scan the QR code or type the address and token below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 正常时可不配置。直连使用局域网或 Tailscale，并会把这台设备的日志发送到 Mac。在 Mac 上打开 QuotaPulse → Hub 与设备，然后扫描二维码，或在下方输入地址和令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Works without iCloud over your network or Tailscale, and sends this device's logs to your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选。无需 iCloud，通过局域网或 Tailscale 工作，并会把这台设备的日志发送到 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Out at \\(Present.resetClock(ex))": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\(Present.resetClock(ex)) 用尽"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "总览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair a device (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对设备（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Percent only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
